&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 410.86666666666666666666666667px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;1.5℃：売上の約0.3％（経常利益の約4.5％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2℃  ：売上の約0.4％（経常利益の約7.3％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;4℃  ：売上の約0.4％（経常利益の約7.3％）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;ｃ．気候関連リスクの財務影響・算定方法&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;イ．税制度（炭素税等）導入による追加コスト&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;[算定方法]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;現在の二酸化炭素排出量×将来の炭素税価格&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;[使用した炭素税価格の将来シナリオ]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;IEA（国際エネルギー機関）が提供するWorld Energy Outlook2023に記載される下記シナリオを採用&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;・1.5℃上昇：NZE2050（Net Zero Emissions by 2050 Scenario）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;・2℃上昇：APS（Announced Pledges Scenario）&lt;/p&gt;
