&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;ｂ．目指す人材の姿&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 6.6666666666666666666666666667px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;    &lt;img alt="0102010_007.png" src="images/0102010_007.png" style="height: 251.6px; width: 600px"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;ｃ．働き方・休み方改革&lt;/p&gt;
